  "dct_description_sm": [
    "<p><br /><br />&nbsp;</p><p style='background-color:white; margin-top:0cm;'><span style='color:black; font-family:Arial; font-size:18px;'><strong>Description</strong></span></p><p style='margin-top:0cm;'><span style='color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px;'>Digital soil mapping (DSM) is a modern approach to soil mapping that combines geo-referenced soil observations with geo-referenced environmental layers to mathematical model soil variation across a landscape as a function of environmental conditions. These Ottawa and Peterborough digital soil maps describe soil property variation in the Ottawa/Peterborough regions via a collection of raster datasets. For information on how these maps were generated, please see the “DSM Data Description” document below</span></p><p><br />&nbsp;</p><p style='margin-top:0cm;'><span style='color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px;'>The Ottawa and Peterborough DSM layers are available as downloadable GeoTIFF files by following the links in the </span><a target='_blank' href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/2026-03-26_Ottawa_Peterborough_DSM_Raster_Directory_EN.docx' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><span style='color:#4169e1; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px;'>DSM Raster Directory</span></a><span style='color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px;'> or by clicking the links to the individual raster packages below. GeoTIFF files require spatial software to view correctly, such as ArcGIS or QGIS.</span></p><p><br />&nbsp;</p><p style='margin-top:0cm;'><span style='color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px;'>These layers can also be visualized online and analyzed via the </span><a target='_blank' href='https://ws.geoservices.lrc.gov.on.ca/arcgis5/rest/services/Thematic' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><span style='color:#4169e1; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px;'>Ottawa ArcGIS REST Services</span></a><span style='color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px;'> or </span><a target='_blank' href='https://ws.geoservices.lrc.gov.on.ca/arcgis5/rest/services/Soils' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><span style='color:#4169e1; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px;'>Peterborough ArcGIS REST Services</span></a><span style='color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px;'> (and then click on your respective soil property for the direct rest service link) or by visiting the </span><a target='_blank' href='https://experience.arcgis.com/experience/8f0e9d0b58424173a149df035df7a583' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><span style='color:#4169e1; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px;'>Ottawa Experience Viewer</span></a><span style='color:black; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px;'> or the </span><a target='_blank' href='https://experience.arcgis.com/experience/4185c8915bfa429483a0b5f911cd3bb6' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><span style='color:#4169e1; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px;'>Peterborough Experience Viewer</span></a><span style='color:black; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px;'>.</span></p><p><br />&nbsp;</p><p style='margin-top:0cm;'><span style='color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px;'>For more information on the functionality of ArcGIS REST services, read the </span><a target='_blank' href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/LIO-OpenDataService-UserGuide.docx' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><span style='color:#4169e1; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px;'>Services User Guide</span></a><span style='color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px;'>. If you have questions about the data itself, please contact </span><a href='mailto:omafra.gis@ontario.ca' rel='nofollow ugc'><span style='color:#4169e1; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px;'>omafra.gis@ontario.ca</span></a></p><p><br /><br />&nbsp;</p><p style='background-color:white; margin-top:0cm;'><span style='color:black; font-family:Arial; font-size:18px;'><strong>Documentation</strong></span></p><p style='background-color:white; margin-top:0cm;'><a target='_blank' href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/2026-03-26_DSM_Data_Description_EN.docx' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><span style='color:#4169e1; font-family:Arial; font-size:14px;'>DSM Data Description.docx</span></a></p><p><br /><br />&nbsp;</p><p style='background-color:white; margin-top:0cm;'><span style='color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:18px;'><strong>Ottawa Data Download</strong></span></p><p style='margin-top:0cm;'><span style='background-color:rgb(255,255,255); color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:14px;'><u>Soil Maps</u></span></p><p style='margin-top:0cm;'><a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/Ottawa_CEC.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><span style='background-color:rgb(255,255,255); color:#4169e1; font-family:Arial; font-size:14px;'>Cation Exchange Capacity</span></a></p><p style='margin-top:0cm;'><a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/Ottawa_pH.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><span style='background-color:rgb(255,255,255); color:#4169e1; font-family:Arial; font-size:14px;'>pH</span></a></p><p style='margin-top:0cm;'><a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/Ottawa_TOC.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><span style='background-color:rgb(255,255,255); color:#4169e1; font-family:Arial; font-size:14px;'>Total Organic Carbon</span></a></p><p style='margin-top:0cm;'><a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/Ottawa_Sand.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><span style='background-color:rgb(255,255,255); color:#4169e1; font-family:Arial; font-size:14px;'>Sand</span></a></p><p style='margin-top:0cm;'><a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/Ottawa_Silt.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><span style='background-color:rgb(255,255,255); color:#4169e1; font-family:Arial; font-size:14px;'>Silt</span></a></p><p style='margin-top:0cm;'><a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/Ottawa_Clay.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><span style='background-color:rgb(255,255,255); color:#4169e1; font-family:Arial; font-size:14px;'>Clay</span></a></p><p style='margin-top:0cm;'><a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/Ottawa_TextureClass.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><span style='background-color:rgb(255,255,255); color:#4169e1; font-family:Arial; font-size:14px;'>Texture Class</span></a></p><p style='background-color:white; margin-top:0cm;'><span style='color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:14px;'><u>Uncertainty (90% Prediction Interval) Maps</u></span></p><p style='background-color:white; margin-top:0cm;'><a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/Ottawa_CEC_PI.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><span style='color:#4169e1; font-family:Arial; font-size:14px;'>Cation Exchange Capacity</span></a></p><p style='background-color:white; margin-top:0cm;'><a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/Ottawa_pH_PI.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><span style='color:#4169e1; font-family:Arial; font-size:14px;'>pH</span></a></p><p style='background-color:white; margin-top:0cm;'><a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/Ottawa_TOC_PI.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><span style='color:#4169e1; font-family:Arial; font-size:14px;'>Total Organic Carbon</span></a></p><p style='background-color:white; margin-top:0cm;'><a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/Ottawa_Sand_PI.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><span style='color:#4169e1; font-family:Arial; font-size:14px;'>Sand</span></a></p><p style='background-color:white; margin-top:0cm;'><a target='_blank' href='https://